1 INJEÇÃO DE CHAVE SEM SENHA

Dentro do Bastion:
Geração:
ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N "" -f ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
Cópia:
cat ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub > /vagrant/chave_bastion.pub

No Windows (Injeção):
vagrant ssh bastion -c "cat /vagrant/chave_bastion.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"
vagrant ssh web1 -c "cat /vagrant/chave_bastion.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"
vagrant ssh web2 -c "cat /vagrant/chave_bastion.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"
vagrant ssh db -c "cat /vagrant/chave_bastion.pub >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"

